        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/e9bcb4/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-03-31T11:06:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I feel like Idealist's concepts will be static buffs to everyone that either</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>* get stronger the more fragments are under it</p><p>* get a different/changed effect depending on what kind of fragment is under them (think Naturalist)</p><p>* will eat up the fragments under them to keep in play&nbsp;</p>",
